@c(14)Tutorial: Brain Overload (BOL)@/c
Pilots who suffer @c(10)Brain Overload@/c cannot deploy, but resting for one battle
will reset their @c(10)BOL@/c.

@c(14)Tutorial: Change Pilots@/c
You can change which pilot you control using @#(29).
Work together to defeat the kaiju.

@c(14)Thought Cloud@/c
Words and names a protagonist sees or hears
may be remembered as @c(10)keywords@/c.

@c(12)Protagonist Selection@/c unlocked!
Remembrance stories branch based on your actions.
Seek out endings you have not seen yet.
